{"case_id":"IG-009","task_pack":"instruction_generation","task_type":"summarization","language":"zh-CN","title":"三句项目状态摘要","input":"将以下状态压缩成恰好3条编号结论，每条不超过35字：数据Schema已冻结；32条开发用例已完成来源检查；8条留出用例尚未解封；模型真实运行尚未开始；不得声称已有分数。","context":[],"expected_output":"三条结论应覆盖已冻结/已完成事项、holdout状态和真实运行/分数边界。","expected_facts":["Schema已冻结","32条开发用例完成来源检查","8条留出未解封","尚无真实运行分数"],"forbidden_facts":["评测已完成","已有模型分数"],"rubric_id":"RUBRIC-IG-V1","rubric":"在恰好三条内准确压缩五项状态，不把计划或未运行事项写成完成。","deterministic_checks":[{"check_id":"IG-009-count","type":"list_item_count","description":"恰好三条编号结论","hard":true,"params":{"exact":3}},{"check_id":"IG-009-key","type":"required_terms","description":"关键数量必须保留","hard":true,"params":{"terms":["32","8"],"mode":"all"}},{"check_id":"IG-009-false","type":"forbidden_terms","description":"不得虚称已完成评测或已有分数","hard":true,"params":{"terms":["评测已完成","已有模型分数"]}}],"tags":["holdout","summary","status_truthfulness"],"source":{"type":"synthetic","name":"LLM Evaluation Workbench synthetic holdout v1","reference":"project-authored:IG-009","license":"CC0-1.0","transformed":false,"design_reason":"留出测试完成态与计划态区分。"},"split":"holdout","version":"1.0"}
{"case_id":"IG-010","task_pack":"instruction_generation","task_type":"risk_response","language":"zh-CN","title":"两个风险及缓解动作","input":"根据场景给出恰好2条“风险：…｜缓解：…”格式的内容：批量评测依赖外部模型接口，且Judge评分可能波动。不要提出增加第二个Judge。","context":[],"expected_output":"一条覆盖接口失败与重试/留痕，一条覆盖Judge波动与固定配置、重复校准或人工复核；不增加第二Judge。","expected_facts":["接口可靠性缓解","Judge稳定性缓解"],"forbidden_facts":["第二个Judge","双Judge","多数投票"],"rubric_id":"RUBRIC-IG-V1","rubric":"两个风险与对应缓解一一匹配，措施符合首版单Judge范围。","deterministic_checks":[{"check_id":"IG-010-count","type":"list_item_count","description":"恰好两条","hard":true,"params":{"exact":2}},{"check_id":"IG-010-format","type":"required_terms","description":"包含风险和缓解字段","hard":true,"params":{"terms":["风险：","缓解："],"mode":"all"}},{"check_id":"IG-010-scope","type":"forbidden_terms","description":"不得扩大为双Judge","hard":true,"params":{"terms":["第二个Judge","双Judge","多数投票"]}}],"tags":["holdout","risk","scope"],"source":{"type":"synthetic","name":"LLM Evaluation Workbench synthetic holdout v1","reference":"project-authored:IG-010","license":"CC0-1.0","transformed":false,"design_reason":"留出测试风险—措施对应及范围遵守。"},"split":"holdout","version":"1.0"}
{"case_id":"GQ-009","task_pack":"grounded_qa","task_type":"conditional_rule","language":"zh-CN","title":"夜间发布例外","input":"周三21:00能否直接发布普通功能更新？如果是紧急安全修复呢？","context":["发布规范：普通功能更新只能在工作日09:00—18:00发布。紧急安全修复不受该时间窗限制，但必须取得值班负责人书面确认并在发布后2小时内补充复盘记录。"],"expected_output":"普通更新不能在周三21:00直接发布；紧急安全修复可例外，但需书面确认并在2小时内补充复盘。","expected_facts":["普通更新不可发布","安全修复例外","书面确认","2小时复盘"],"forbidden_facts":["所有更新都禁止","安全修复可无条件发布"],"rubric_id":"RUBRIC-GQ-V1","rubric":"分别回答普通更新和紧急安全修复，完整保留例外的两个附加条件。","deterministic_checks":[{"check_id":"GQ-009-conditions","type":"required_terms","description":"时间窗例外的附加条件完整","hard":true,"params":{"terms":["安全修复","书面确认","2小时"],"mode":"all"}},{"check_id":"GQ-009-unconditional","type":"forbidden_terms","description":"不得把例外写成无条件","hard":true,"params":{"terms":["无条件发布","可以直接发布且无需确认"]}}],"tags":["holdout","grounded","exception"],"source":{"type":"synthetic","name":"LLM Evaluation Workbench synthetic holdout v1","reference":"project-authored:GQ-009","license":"CC0-1.0","transformed":false,"design_reason":"留出测试主规则、例外与附加条件。"},"split":"holdout","version":"1.0"}
{"case_id":"GQ-010","task_pack":"grounded_qa","task_type":"insufficient_evidence","language":"zh-CN","title":"缺少地域范围的服务承诺","input":"这项服务在深圳是否承诺4小时上门？","context":["华东区域服务说明：上海、杭州和苏州的标准客户可享受工作时间内4小时上门响应。其他城市的服务时限以当地合同为准。"],"expected_output":"资料只覆盖华东列出的三座城市，不能据此确认深圳4小时上门；需要查看深圳当地合同。","expected_facts":["适用范围不含深圳","无法确认","查看当地合同"],"forbidden_facts":["深圳承诺4小时上门"],"rubric_id":"RUBRIC-GQ-V1","rubric":"识别地域适用范围，不能把华东规则外推到深圳，并指出所需证据。","deterministic_checks":[{"check_id":"GQ-010-scope","type":"required_terms","description":"指出深圳需当地合同","hard":true,"params":{"terms":["深圳","当地合同"],"mode":"all"}},{"check_id":"GQ-010-invent","type":"forbidden_terms","description":"不得确认不存在的承诺","hard":true,"params":{"terms":["深圳承诺4小时","深圳也享受4小时"]}}],"tags":["holdout","grounded","scope","insufficient_evidence"],"source":{"type":"synthetic","name":"LLM Evaluation Workbench synthetic holdout v1","reference":"project-authored:GQ-010","license":"CC0-1.0","transformed":false,"design_reason":"留出测试适用范围和证据不足。"},"split":"holdout","version":"1.0"}
{"case_id":"MT-009","task_pack":"multi_turn","task_type":"constraint_update","language":"zh-CN","title":"输出格式的最新变更","input":"现在输出最终报告结构。","context":[],"expected_output":"只输出标题和风险清单，不再包含原先要求的结论摘要。","expected_facts":["标题","风险清单","不含结论摘要"],"forbidden_facts":["结论摘要"],"rubric_id":"RUBRIC-MT-V1","rubric":"采用最后一轮的格式更新，保留仍有效的标题要求并删除失效的结论摘要。","deterministic_checks":[{"check_id":"MT-009-required","type":"required_terms","description":"保留标题和风险清单","hard":true,"params":{"terms":["标题","风险"],"mode":"all"}},{"check_id":"MT-009-removed","type":"forbidden_terms","description":"不得保留被取消的结论摘要","hard":true,"params":{"terms":["结论摘要"]}}],"tags":["holdout","multi_turn","format_update"],"source":{"type":"synthetic","name":"LLM Evaluation Workbench synthetic holdout v1","reference":"project-authored:MT-009","license":"CC0-1.0","transformed":false,"design_reason":"留出测试部分约束保留与部分约束撤销。"},"split":"holdout","version":"1.0","turns":[{"role":"user","content":"报告要包含标题、结论摘要和风险清单。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"收到，将按三个部分组织。"},{"role":"user","content":"取消结论摘要，只保留标题和风险清单。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"收到，已更新格式。"}]}
{"case_id":"MT-010","task_pack":"multi_turn","task_type":"conflict_clarification","language":"zh-CN","title":"未解决的时间冲突","input":"请直接发出最终会议通知。","context":[],"expected_output":"指出周二与周三存在未解决冲突，请用户确认后再形成最终通知。","expected_facts":["时间冲突","请求确认"],"forbidden_facts":["会议确定在周二","会议确定在周三"],"rubric_id":"RUBRIC-MT-V1","rubric":"对话中两位参与者提出不同日期且用户未裁决，不能擅自选择，必须请求确认。","deterministic_checks":[{"check_id":"MT-010-clarify","type":"required_terms","description":"指出冲突并请求确认","hard":true,"params":{"terms":["冲突","确认"],"mode":"all"}},{"check_id":"MT-010-assume","type":"forbidden_terms","description":"不得擅自确定日期","hard":true,"params":{"terms":["确定在周二","确定在周三"]}}],"tags":["holdout","multi_turn","conflict","clarification"],"source":{"type":"synthetic","name":"LLM Evaluation Workbench synthetic holdout v1","reference":"project-authored:MT-010","license":"CC0-1.0","transformed":false,"design_reason":"留出测试未决冲突和澄清路由。"},"split":"holdout","version":"1.0","turns":[{"role":"user","content":"小王建议周二下午开评审会。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"已记录小王建议周二下午。"},{"role":"user","content":"小李只能周三下午参加。"},{"role":"assistant","content":"已记录小李只能周三下午。"}]}
{"case_id":"ST-009","task_pack":"structured_tool","task_type":"structured_output","language":"zh-CN","title":"带数组的发票 JSON","input":"只输出JSON：发票号INV-77，开票日期2026-07-30，明细为咨询服务1项单价800元、资料费2项单价50元，合计900元。字段invoice_id、date、items[{name,quantity,unit_price}]、total。","context":[],"expected_output":"{\"invoice_id\":\"INV-77\",\"date\":\"2026-07-30\",\"items\":[{\"name\":\"咨询服务\",\"quantity\":1,\"unit_price\":800},{\"name\":\"资料费\",\"quantity\":2,\"unit_price\":50}],\"total\":900}","expected_facts":["两条明细","合计900"],"forbidden_facts":[],"rubric_id":"RUBRIC-ST-V1","rubric":"准确提取嵌套数组、数量、单价和总额，不增加字段或解释。","deterministic_checks":[{"check_id":"ST-009-schema","type":"json_schema","description":"发票 JSON Schema 正确","hard":true,"params":{"schema":{"type":"object","required":["invoice_id","date","items","total"],"properties":{"invoice_id":{"type":"string"},"date":{"type":"string"},"items":{"type":"array","minItems":2,"maxItems":2,"items":{"type":"object","required":["name","quantity","unit_price"],"properties":{"name":{"type":"string"},"quantity":{"type":"integer"},"unit_price":{"type":"number"}},"additionalProperties":false}},"total":{"type":"number"}},"additionalProperties":false}}},{"check_id":"ST-009-values","type":"json_field_values","description":"主字段值准确","hard":true,"params":{"expected":{"invoice_id":"INV-77","date":"2026-07-30","total":900}}}],"tags":["holdout","json","array"],"source":{"type":"synthetic","name":"LLM Evaluation Workbench synthetic holdout v1","reference":"project-authored:ST-009","license":"CC0-1.0","transformed":false,"design_reason":"留出测试嵌套数组和数值绑定。"},"split":"holdout","version":"1.0"}
{"case_id":"ST-010","task_pack":"structured_tool","task_type":"function_call","language":"zh-CN","title":"按编号查询工单","input":"查询工单TK-908的当前状态，并根据工具结果告诉我负责人和下一步。","context":[],"expected_output":"调用get_ticket(ticket_id=TK-908)，再说明状态待客户确认、负责人魏宁、下一步联系客户确认复现步骤。","expected_facts":["正确工具参数","负责人魏宁","待客户确认","联系客户"],"forbidden_facts":[],"rubric_id":"RUBRIC-ST-V1","rubric":"必须按精确工单号调用工具，并完整使用工具返回的状态、负责人和下一步。","deterministic_checks":[{"check_id":"ST-010-tool","type":"tool_calls","description":"查询工具和工单号准确","hard":true,"params":{}},{"check_id":"ST-010-result","type":"required_terms","description":"最终回答使用三项工具结果","hard":false,"params":{"terms":["待客户确认","魏宁","联系客户"],"mode":"all"}}],"tags":["holdout","function_call","tool_result"],"source":{"type":"synthetic","name":"LLM Evaluation Workbench synthetic holdout v1","reference":"project-authored:ST-010","license":"CC0-1.0","transformed":false,"design_reason":"留出测试标识参数与多字段结果使用。"},"split":"holdout","version":"1.0","available_tools":[{"type":"function","function":{"name":"get_ticket","description":"按工单编号查询状态","parameters":{"type":"object","required":["ticket_id"],"properties":{"ticket_id":{"type":"string"}},"additionalProperties":false}}}],"expected_tools":[{"name":"get_ticket","arguments":{"ticket_id":"TK-908"},"order":0,"allow_extra_arguments":false}],"tool_outputs":[{"name":"get_ticket","output":{"status":"待客户确认","owner":"魏宁","next_action":"联系客户确认复现步骤"}}],"expected_final_behavior":"说明工单待客户确认，负责人魏宁，下一步联系客户确认复现步骤。"}
